        "Scrub the chapter's foundation: define statistical mediation analysis as an analytical process using OLS regression or SEMs, and walk through the two regression equations that define the a-path, b-path, and direct effect. Compute the indirect effect as the product a1 times b1, show how the indirect and direct effects sum to the total effect, and extend the equations to include covariates, referencing the path diagram in Figure 25.1 throughout.",
